Prebuilt cross toolchain: Bootlin aarch64--glibc--stable-2025.08-1
(https://toolchains.bootlin.com). Its C library and compiler runtime libraries are
copied into the NimbleZero image:
  glibc (libc, libm, ld.so, ...)        LGPL-2.1+            COPYING.LIB
  libgcc, libstdc++, libatomic          GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library Exception
                                        COPYING3 + COPYING.RUNTIME
summary.csv is Bootlin's own manifest for this toolchain: every component with its
version, licence and upstream source archive. Bootlin mirrors those archives at
https://toolchains.bootlin.com/downloads/releases/sources/ .
